  {
   "id": 919,
   "hub_id": 13874,
   "version": "1.2.1",
   "description": "<p><strong>For SPT 3.11.X Only</strong></p>\n<p>Fixed issue with keycard doors not being unlockable. They now are excluded from doors that you can lock.</p>\n<p>If you previously locked one of these doors and need to force it unlocked, press ~ to open the console while in raid and run the <strong>unlock_all_player_locked_doors</strong> command.</p>\n",
   "link": "https://sp-mod.com/mod/download/1923/lockable-doors/1.2.1",
   "content_length": null,
   "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0",
