  {
   "id": 171,
   "hub_id": 14708,
   "version": "1.3.0",
   "description": "<p><strong>For SPT 3.11.X Only</strong></p>\n<p>Couple new features!</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Unlock All Doors At End Of Raid</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Old Lock Falloff</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>Makes it so that if you are at your cap for locked doors, and you lock <em>another</em> door, it unlocks the oldest locked door. Lets you keep locking doors without needing to go back and unlock the old ones or run the console command.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Both features are off by default, turn them on in F12 menu.</p>\n<p>This update required a bit of refactoring, so lmk if you run into bugs.</p>\n",
   "link": "https://sp-mod.com/mod/download/1923/lockable-doors/1.3.0",
